      <li>Added Ukrainian localization — thanks to <a href="https://www.unibrix.com/" target="_blank">@Valera
          Oleksiienko</a> for the translation.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Improvements</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Improved server response speed across different regions</li>
      <li>Enhanced error descriptions for activation failures</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Fixes</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed an issue where the Settings window did not appear centered</li>
      <li>Fixed an issue with renaming apps inside folders</li>
      <li>Fixed an issue where Hot Corners might not activate immediately after restarting the Mac</li>
    </ul>
