      <li>Added Spanish localization — thanks to <a href="https://rodrigonavarrete.cl" target="_blank">@Rodrigo
          Navarrete</a> for the translation</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Improvements</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Improved Hot Corner sensitivity</li>
      <li>Optimized resource usage</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Fixes</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed an occasional issue where system permission prompts could appear unexpectedly</li>
      <li>Fixed an occasional issue where text colors in input fields displayed incorrectly</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <header>
      <h2>v1.1.4</h2>
