      <li>Fixed issue where the update window did not automatically appear in the foreground</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <header>
      <h2>v1.1.2</h2>
      <time>Nov 19, 2025</time>
    </header>

    <h3>New</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Added support for displaying alias apps</li>
      <li>Added Korean localization — thanks to @darang for the translation</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Improvements</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Improved app dragging to avoid unintended actions when flipping pages</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Fixes</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed a flickering issue when quickly opening or closing Launchpad</li>
      <li>Fixed an issue where moving apps via right-click didn’t work on the search results page</li>
      <li>Fixed display issues when switching desktops with a three-finger swipe</li>
      <li>Fixed app names showing file extensions when “Show all filename extensions” is enabled in Finder</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <header>
      <h2>v1.1.1</h2>
      <time>Nov 10, 2025</time>
    </header>
    <h3>New</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Added support for Japanese and German</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Improvements</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed issue where app icons did not refresh immediately after changing icon style</li>
      <li>Fixed issue where the desktop could not be activated immediately after close</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <header>
      <h2>v1.1.0</h2>
      <time>Nov 7, 2025</time>
    </header>
    <h3>New</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Added support for hidden apps</li>
      <li>Automatically create a new page when dragging an app to the edge of the last page in paged mode</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Improvements</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Optimized app bundle size</li>
      <li>Improve app stability</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Fixes</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed issue where LaunchOS would not appear when other apps are in full screen</li>
      <li>Fixed issue where empty folders were not automatically deleted after moving apps</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <header>
      <h2>v1.0.0</h2>
      <time>Oct 31, 2025</time>
    </header>

    <h3>New</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Support for custom app names</li>
      <li>Option to choose whether to rearrange apps when adjusting layout</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Improvements</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Improved app placement logic: apps fill available pages in paged mode and appear at the end in scroll mode
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Fixes</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed incomplete folder display issue</li>
      <li>Fixed crash when dragging apps to the end of the list</li>
      <li>Fixed occasional freeze when dragging apps</li>
      <li>Fixed issue where app icon might appear blank due to delayed info updates</li>
      <li>Fixed missing translations in some UI texts</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <header>
      <h2>Beta - v0.9.5</h2>
      <time>Oct 28, 2025</time>
    </header>
    <h3>New</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Supports importing system Launchpad data</li>
      <li>Supports customizing which screen LaunchOS appears on</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Improvements</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Optimized performance, with more improvements on the way</li>
      <li>Reduced installer package size</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Fixes</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed issue where shortcut keys (cmd+a, cmd+c, cmd+v) did not work in input fields</li>
      <li>Fixed issue where folders that were open did not automatically close when quitting LaunchOS</li>
      <li>Fixed issue where right-click on empty folders did not work</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <header>
      <h2>Beta - v0.9.4</h2>
      <time>Oct 20, 2025</time>
    </header>

    <h3>Improvements</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Improved search matching with support for English and Pinyin initials (e.g. "as" → Apple Store, "jsq" →
        Calculator「计算器」)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Fixes</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Improved display in system Light mode</li>
      <li>Fixed a blank page issue caused by drag actions in paged mode</li>
      <li>Fixed display issues on multiple monitors</li>
      <li>Fixed an issue where folders could not be moved via right-click when a folder is open</li>
      <li>Fixed search behavior in paged mode</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <header>
      <h2>Beta - v0.9.3</h2>
      <time>Oct 16, 2025</time>
    </header>

    <h3>New</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>In-app update support</li>
      <li>Customizable background</li>
      <li>Custom LaunchOS app icon</li>
      <li>New shortcuts (cmd+,: Settings, cmd+q: Quit, cmd+←/→: Page switch)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Improvements</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Improved app launch and switching performance</li>
      <li>Optimized drag-and-drop inside folders</li>
      <li>Optimized startup behavior with silent launch</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Fixes</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed an issue where drag-and-drop may fail in scroll mode</li>
      <li>Fixed missing cursor and occasional crashes in folder editing</li>
      <li>Fixed inconsistent blank area width when the Dock is on the left or right</li>
      <li>Fixed wallpaper not updating in time</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <header>
      <h2>Beta - v0.9.2</h2>
      <time>Oct 11, 2025</time>
    </header>
    <h3>New</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Added support for launching Launchpad via Hot Corners</li>
      <li>Added French language support, thanks to @Cyril Guislain for the translation</li>
      <li>Added Settings panel shortcut to the menubar icon's right-click menu</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Improvements</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Launchpad panel can now be closed by pressing the hotkey again</li>
      <li>Settings panel now follows system light/dark appearance</li>
      <li>Settings window can now be closed with the ESC key</li>
      <li>Settings window can also be dismissed by clicking outside the window</li>
      <li>Improved UI details and overall visual consistency</li>
      <li>Launchpad will always appears on the main screen instead of the active one</li>
      <li>Optimized performance, with more improvements on the way</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <header>
      <h2>Beta - v0.9.1</h2>
