    <ul>
      <li>Optimized performance, with more improvements on the way</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Fixes</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed apps missing after grid layout change</li>
      <li>Fixed issue where Logitech mouse could not scroll pages with Logi Options+</li>
    </ul>
